        <item>
            <title>260822.1</title>
            <pubDate>Sat, 22 Aug 2026 21:49:32 +0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/cxa/yiyan</link>
            <sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>https://github.com/cxa/yiyan/blob/main/RELEASE_NOTES.md</sparkle:fullReleaseNotesLink>
            <sparkle:version>2608.22.1</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>260822.1</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### What’s improved

- YiYan now skips messages that contain only a web link, keeping your learning
  history focused on writing worth reviewing. Sentences that include a link
  continue to be collected as usual.

### 本次改进

- 《绎言》现在会跳过只包含网页链接的消息，让学习记录更专注于值得回顾的
  表达；包含链接的完整句子仍会照常收录。
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/cxa/yiyan/releases/download/v260822.1/YiYan-260822.1.dmg" length="7854424" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="gLSqTC5f1UQqRYsUzdfCyF9USyKlcEwcI7IWJ82cmqw1rG9SmoLWsPl7k+9eB/CihVA1KQ76Jged+05+ceAADg=="/>
